2026-08-02: Implemented the permitted-column heterogeneous topology, cutoff-frozen mean and age-weighted relation states, two relation-wise GraphSAGE transformations, determinant towers, document DeepSets pooling, and protected hierarchical-posterior residual head.
2026-08-02: Implemented Model A train-only validation inference, Model B train-plus-validation test-state rebuild and June refit, forward-fold blend selection, one-layer/100k-node debug behavior, cache registration, and deterministic fallback outputs.
